@startuml
title Persona #1 – Newbie / First-Time Visitor (Cold Traffic, Compliant Flow)

start

:'Visitor lands on site\n(Ad / SEO / Referral)';
note right
US-01: Understand value quickly
User goal: decide if worth attention
end note

:'Ask if value understood\n(QuickAnswerActivity: ValueCheck)';
if (Value understood?) then (Yes)
  :Continue;
else (No)
  :Exit site (bounce)\n(EndActivity: BounceExit)';
  stop
endif

:'Display trust signals\n(AdaptiveCardActivity: TrustSignalsCard)';
note right
US-02: Establish trust
end note

:'Ask if trust sufficient\n(QuickAnswerActivity: TrustCheck)';
if (Trust sufficient?) then (Yes)
  :Proceed;
else (No)
  :Passive browse or exit\n(EndActivity: PassiveExit)';
  stop
endif

:'Early contact capture\n(AdaptiveCardActivity: ContactCaptureCard)';
note right
Business goal:
Capture lead ASAP
end note

if (Contact info provided?) then (Yes)
  :Store contact (pending consent);
else (No)
  :Allow limited anonymous browsing\n(EndActivity: AnonBrowseExit)';
  stop
endif

:'Display TCPA consent\n(AdaptiveCardActivity: TcpaConsentCard)';
note right
LEGAL:
Required to contact lead
end note

:'Ask if TCPA consent given\n(QuickAnswerActivity: TcpaCheck)';
if (TCPA consent given?) then (Yes)
  :Record TCPA consent\n(timestamp, IP, version);
else (No)
  :Mark lead as non-contactable;
endif

:'Display CCPA notice\n(AdaptiveCardActivity: CcpaNoticeCard)';
note right
LEGAL:
Notice & acknowledgement
end note

:'Record CCPA acknowledgement';

:'Show "Who this insurance is for"\n(AdaptiveCardActivity: ApplicabilityCard)';
note right
US-03: Applicability check
end note

:'Ask if applicable\n(QuickAnswerActivity: ApplicabilityCheck)';
if (Visitor feels applicable?) then (Yes)
  :Continue education;
else (No)
  :Exit with trust preserved\n(EndActivity: TrustExit)';
  stop
endif

:'Explain insurance types\n(AdaptiveCardActivity: InsuranceTypesCard)';
note right
US-04: Learn without committing
end note

:'Ask if wants guidance\n(QuickAnswerActivity: GuidanceCheck)';
if (Visitor wants guidance?) then (Yes)
  :Start AI-assisted guidance\n(TriggerTopicActivity: GuidanceTopic)';
else (No)
  :Continue browsing content;
endif

:'Ask light qualification questions\n(AdaptiveCardActivity: LightQualCard)';
note right
Business goal:
Non-sensitive qualification
end note

:'Ask if enough info\n(QuickAnswerActivity: QualCheck)';
if (Enough qualification info?) then (Yes)
  :Personalized guidance\n(not a quote);
else (No)
  :Offer to continue later\n(EndActivity: LaterExit)';
  stop
endif

:'Ask if requests human help\n(QuickAnswerActivity: HumanHelpCheck)';
if (Visitor requests human help?) then (Yes)
  :Transfer to live agent\n(EscalateActivity: AgentTransfer)';
  note right
Warm handoff
TCPA required = Yes
end note
else (No)
  :Continue AI assistance;
endif

:'Ask if ready to proceed\n(QuickAnswerActivity: ProceedCheck)';
if (Visitor ready to proceed?) then (Yes)
  :Advance to next funnel stage\n(TriggerTopicActivity: NextStageTopic)';
else (No)
  :Allow exit with follow-up permitted\n(EndActivity: FollowUpExit)';
endif

stop
@enduml